Formula to get spend at ROI threshold is:

!Screenshot 2024-04-03 at 12.46.36.png|width=438,height=36,alt="Screenshot 2024-04-03 at 12.46.36.png"!

Spend at required Uplift to Cost Ratio = sqrt(Lam*Vmax * Coef / Ratio) - Lam

Some functions we used:

*Functions*

{noformat}def mm_saturation(cost, vmax, lam):
    return (vmax*cost)/(lam+cost)

def mm_saturation_derivative(cost, vmax, lam):
    return (vmax*lam)/((lam+cost)**2)

def mm_saturation_step_diff(cost, vmax, lam, step):
    prev_cost = cost - step    
    return (mm_saturation(cost, vmax, lam) - mm_saturation(prev_cost, vmax, lam))/step{noformat}

