We create on the fly and return the token:
```    private constructToken(benefit?: BenefitWithReference): string | undefined {
        return benefit
            ? this.tokenCodec.encode({
                  reference_id: benefit.reference_id,
                  reference_type: benefit.reference_type,
                  benefit_id: benefit.id,
              })
            : undefined;
    }```

